  "releaseNotes": "Fixes initial Windows placement for custom-titlebar windows using actual frame dimensions, owner centering, and monitor work-area limits. Includes a build-time Windows Direct2D text workaround restricted to MewUI 0.22.1: system parameters at 96 DPI and original smoothing above 96 DPI. Documents framework workarounds and their removal conditions. Built and tested with MewUI 0.22.1; public APIs may change between preview releases.",
